    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We want the best 4-year universities in the country, and we also want more schools to train students in the skilled trades - to be electricians, welders, plumbers, &amp; carpenters. Those goals aren\u2019t in tension, they actually go together.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2057198693275849105",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-20T20:36:04+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The problem with many liberal arts universities over the last decade isn\u2019t merely that they were \u201ctoo liberal,\u201d but that they actually *abandoned* the values of classical liberalism they once proclaimed: individualism, free speech, and open debate.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2057198131444605311",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-20T20:33:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019ll prosecute Medicaid fraud, recover billions, and strike a deal with the feds that allows Ohio to keep most of the savings. That\u2019s the first step to make healthcare more affordable after I\u2019m elected. Details are in my WSJ piece today:\nwsj.com/opinion/an-easy-way-\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2057181828772147711",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-20T19:29:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019re going to bring high-paying jobs back to Ohio in droves. Great time meeting the workers at Uline in Etna, Ohio today. Lower costs, bigger paychecks, coming soon.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2057176408171184178",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-20T19:07:30+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "My message to doctors, nurses, and other healthcare providers: I\u2019ll create a state where you can spend more time caring for patients instead of filling out mountains of paperwork. That actually goes hand-in-hand with combating Medicaid fraud.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056809330809487758",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T18:48:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s time for a fresh approach in Ohio.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056808992408850858",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T18:47:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "An uncomfortable truth: over the last decade, Ohio Medicaid enrollees have increased from 2.9 million to 3 million, while Ohio\u2019s Medicaid expenses have risen from $27 billion to $47 billion. This is insanity.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056794156014723106",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T17:48:34+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s the truth.\n\n\nDaily Wire (@realDailyWire)\n\n.@VivekGRamaswamy thanks @lukerosiak for his investigation into Ohio Medicaid fraud:\n\n\"I think it's fair to say that if you had not just reported the facts the people in this room who are working hard to solve these problems wouldn't have the platform...to make this a priority.\"\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/realDailyWire/status/2056758189324898805#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056773064608899260",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T16:24:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I\u2019ll strike a sensible win-win deal with the federal government in January to allow Ohioans to keep more of the savings from crushing Medicaid fraud &amp; then make that a top priority for the first 6 months of my administration.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056766274404007985",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T15:57:47+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Simple formula: crush Medicaid fraud &amp; put that $$ back in the pockets of Ohioans. Shouldn\u2019t be controversial.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056765267922092187",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T15:53:47+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ending the epidemic of Medicaid fraud requires a leader at the top who\u2019s willing to shake up the bureaucracy. That\u2019s exactly what I\u2019ll do &amp; bring some real government efficiency to Ohio.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056760294404460964",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T15:34:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Crushing Medicaid fraud is one of the simplest ways to make healthcare more affordable. Most healthcare policies force a painful trade-off between cost, access and quality, but this one doesn\u2019t: It takes money from criminals and returns it to the families who play by the rules.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056753013327630419",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T15:05:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\ud83d\udd34 LIVE: Crushing Fraud. Lowering Healthcare Costs. nitter.net/i/broadcasts/1dGYljEYz\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056750743584137364",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T14:56:04+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\ud83d\udd34 LIVE: Crushing Fraud. Lowering Healthcare Costs. nitter.net/i/broadcasts/1yxBeMgaA\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056744991477600390",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T14:33:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A leftist who ruined Ohio\u2019s Department of Health can\u2019t &amp; won\u2019t solve the Medicaid fraud epidemic. It\u2019s time for a businessman to fix the problem.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056744813463298150",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T14:32:30+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There are literally 10 different agencies in the Ohio government bureaucracy that administer Medicaid payments. It\u2019s unnecessarily complicated, makes audits impossible, and diffuses accountability. That will change once I take office.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056740426850455895",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T14:15:04+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019re going to go so fast they won\u2019t know what hit them. Laying out the plan to combat Medicaid fraud in Ohio later this morning.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056740044443136300",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T14:13:33+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019re going to crush Medicaid fraud in Ohio aggressively, using emergency measures, starting on Day 1. Press conference starting at 10:30am to lay it out.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2056727324520005800",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T13:23:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
